<http://data.silknow.org/object/2a19385c-0065-3abf-8afb-a1feed4e23a2/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of woven silk.\nSilk twill; Hussein Kuli Khan type.\n\nBroad stripes:\n[1] pink or possibly orange ground with a broken and not very obvious blue meandering stem and many disjointed leaves and flowerheads. Details in white, green and light blue.\n[2] white ground with the same design but details in pink, green and light blue.\nThese are separated by a  narrow stripe:\n[3] dark blue ground with red meander and green and blue leaves and flowerheads.\n[4] pink ground with isolated sprigs: blue flower above green leaf, 3-petalled sprig. All with dark blue outlines.\nWarp: white, red, dark blue and orange silk.\nWeft: white, light blue, light green, orange, light red silk all S-twist and dark blue silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/2a19385c-0065-3abf-8afb-a1feed4e23a2> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/2a19385c-0065-3abf-8afb-a1feed4e23a2/domain/2>
